    "title": "Silicone Food Bag Clips – Reusable Sealing Lock 3 Pack",
    "body_html": "<p>Silicone food bag clips provide an efficient way to seal your packets and keep food fresh longer. These reusable silicone sealing clips feature an adjustable elastic lock for a tight seal, perfectly designed to maintain the freshness of your snacks and ingredients.</p>\n <h2>Key features</h2>\n <ul>\n <li>Durable silicone material offering high elasticity and resistance to deformation</li>\n <li>Adjustable elastic button lock fits both small and large bags securely</li>\n <li>Ergonomic pull ring design for easy handling and hanging storage</li>\n <li>Compact size ideal for resealing half-eaten snack packets</li>\n <li>Multi-purpose utility also as cable and cord organizers for home and office</li>\n <li>Simple locking mechanism preserves freshness and prevents spills</li>\n <li>Reusable and environmentally friendly alternative to disposable clips</li>\n </ul>\n <h2>Materials &amp; care</h2>\n <p>The clips are made of durable TEP silicone material. To clean, simply wash with warm water and mild detergent. Ensure clips are completely dry before storing to maintain their elasticity and functionality.</p>\n <h2>FAQ</h2>\n <dl>\n <dt>Q1: What is a silicone food bag clip?</dt>\n <dd>A: A silicone food bag clip is a reusable clip made from silicone designed to seal bags and keep food fresh by creating an airtight lock.</dd>\n <dt>Q2: Can these clips fit all bag sizes?</dt>\n <dd>A: Yes, the adjustable elastic locking button allows these clips to fit a variety of bag sizes securely.</dd>\n <dt>Q3: Are these clips safe for food contact?</dt>\n <dd>A: Yes, these clips are made from food-safe TEP silicone material suitable for kitchen use.</dd>\n <dt>Q4: Can these clips be used for other purposes?</dt>\n <dd>A: Absolutely! Besides sealing food bags, they also serve as cable ties or cord organizers around the home or office.</dd>\n <dt>Q5: How do I clean and maintain these clips?</dt>\n <dd>A: Wash with mild detergent and warm water. Dry completely before reuse to keep the clips in optimal condition.</dd>\n </dl>\n<!-- dims:start -->\n<div class=\"product-dimensions\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong>Product Dimensions</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Length</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">15 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Width</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">8 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Height</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">3 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Weight</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">24 g</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<!-- dims:end -->",
